        "created_at": "2016-02-03T23:21:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I use Resolute, give Santa Guise a power, he flips the cards in my play area.</p><p>This order occurs:</p><p>Prayer of Desperation-&gt;Smite the Transgressor.</p><p>So it is Fanatic's turn, during the middle of Resolute (still have top card to play) My turn ends and I get to use a power. &nbsp;I use Resolute to let Santa Guise flip another hero's cards.</p><p>This is all legal right? &nbsp;They would flip all their cards, I would continue to flip my cards, and then when that is done I would play the top 2 cards of my deck.</p><p>I should be able to use both powers a second time because it is no longer the same turn.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:26.747Z",
