        "raw": "<p>So I use Resolute, give Santa Guise a power, he flips the cards in my play area.</p><p>This order occurs:</p><p>Prayer of Desperation-&gt;Smite the Transgressor.</p><p>So it is Fanatic&#39;s turn, during the middle of Resolute (still have top card to play) My turn ends and I get to use a power. &nbsp;I use Resolute to let Santa Guise flip another hero&#39;s cards.</p><p>This is all legal right? &nbsp;They would flip all their cards, I would continue to flip my cards, and then when that is done I would play the top 2 cards of my deck.</p><p>I should be able to use both powers a second time because it is no longer the same turn.</p>",
